{"body": "Session Law 2023-134 updated the NC individual income tax rate for future tax years. The new rate for each tax year is as follows:\n\nFor Taxable Years beginning in 2025, the North Carolina individual income tax rate is 4.25% (0.0425).\n\nFor Taxable Years after 2025, the North Carolina individual income tax rate is 3.99% (0.0399).\n\nAdditional rate changes may apply to tax years beginning with 2027 based on certain rate reduction triggers. For more information, see Session Law 2023-134 .", "citation_label": "Tax Rate Schedules (current tax year rates: 3.99% for taxable years after 2025) 1", "citation_path": "us-nc/guidance/ncdor/ty2026/tax-rate-schedules/block-1", "document_class": "guidance", "expression_date": "2026-01-01", "heading": "Current Tax Year Rates", "id": "68ca9a45-c8b4-5143-80d6-87b75db4c234", "jurisdiction": "us-nc", "kind": "block", "language": "en", "level": 2, "metadata": {"amounts_carried": ["flat rate by year (2025 4.25%; after 2025 3.99%)"], "block_count": 2, "closure_element": "F06", "content_type": "text/html; charset=UTF-8", "discovered_via": "manual-review:tax-agent-queue; index https://www.ncdor.gov/taxes-forms/individual-income-tax/tax-rate-schedules (read 2026-09-13)", "document_subtype": "department_web_page", "download_url": "https://www.ncdor.gov/taxes-forms/individual-income-tax/tax-rate-schedules", "index_url": "https://www.ncdor.gov/taxes-forms/individual-income-tax/tax-rate-schedules", "kind": "block", "primary_source": true, "program": "individual_income_tax", "publication_or_revision_date": null, "source_authority": "North Carolina Department of Revenue", "source_family": "state-ty2026-indexed-amounts", "source_url": "https://www.ncdor.gov/taxes-forms/individual-income-tax/tax-rate-schedules", "tax_year": "2026", "title": "Tax Rate Schedules (current tax year rates: 3.99% for taxable years after 2025)"}, "ordinal": 1, "parent_citation_path": "us-nc/guidance/ncdor/ty2026/tax-rate-schedules", "parent_id": "882cadc4-3ee0-56c7-b13f-acc0fddeb9f4", "source_as_of": "2026-09-14", "source_format": "html", "source_id": "us-nc-ncdor-tax-rate-schedules-ty2026", "source_path": "sources/us-nc/guidance/2026-09-14-ty2026-indexed-amounts/official-documents/us-nc-ncdor-tax-rate-schedules-ty2026.html", "source_url": "https://www.ncdor.gov/taxes-forms/individual-income-tax/tax-rate-schedules", "version": "2026-09-14-ty2026-indexed-amounts"}
{"body": "Tax Year 2024\n\nTax Year 2023\n\nTax Year 2022\n\nTax Years 2019-2021\n\nTax Years 2017-2018\n\nTax Years 2015-2016\n\nFor Tax Year 2024, the North Carolina individual income tax rate is 4.50% (0.0450).\n\nFor Tax Year 2023, the North Carolina individual income tax rate is 4.75% (0.0475).\n\nFor Tax Year 2022, the North Carolina individual income tax rate is 4.99% (0.0499).\n\nFor Tax Years 2019, 2020, and 2021 the North Carolina individual income tax rate is 5.25% (0.0525).\n\nFor Tax Years 2017 and 2018, the North Carolina individual income tax rate is 5.499% (0.05499).\n\nFor Tax Years 2015 and 2016, the North Carolina individual income tax rate is 5.75% (0.0575).", "citation_label": "Tax Rate Schedules (current tax year rates: 3.99% for taxable years after 2025) 2", "citation_path": "us-nc/guidance/ncdor/ty2026/tax-rate-schedules/block-2", "document_class": "guidance", "expression_date": "2026-01-01", "heading": "Previous Tax Year Rates", "id": "08ca3e15-83ea-5ade-8164-499c76074f60", "jurisdiction": "us-nc", "kind": "block", "language": "en", "level": 2, "metadata": {"amounts_carried": ["flat rate by year (2025 4.25%; after 2025 3.99%)"], "block_count": 2, "closure_element": "F06", "content_type": "text/html; charset=UTF-8", "discovered_via": "manual-review:tax-agent-queue; index https://www.ncdor.gov/taxes-forms/individual-income-tax/tax-rate-schedules (read 2026-09-13)", "document_subtype": "department_web_page", "download_url": "https://www.ncdor.gov/taxes-forms/individual-income-tax/tax-rate-schedules", "index_url": "https://www.ncdor.gov/taxes-forms/individual-income-tax/tax-rate-schedules", "kind": "block", "primary_source": true, "program": "individual_income_tax", "publication_or_revision_date": null, "source_authority": "North Carolina Department of Revenue", "source_family": "state-ty2026-indexed-amounts", "source_url": "https://www.ncdor.gov/taxes-forms/individual-income-tax/tax-rate-schedules", "tax_year": "2026", "title": "Tax Rate Schedules (current tax year rates: 3.99% for taxable years after 2025)"}, "ordinal": 2, "parent_citation_path": "us-nc/guidance/ncdor/ty2026/tax-rate-schedules", "parent_id": "882cadc4-3ee0-56c7-b13f-acc0fddeb9f4", "source_as_of": "2026-09-14", "source_format": "html", "source_id": "us-nc-ncdor-tax-rate-schedules-ty2026", "source_path": "sources/us-nc/guidance/2026-09-14-ty2026-indexed-amounts/official-documents/us-nc-ncdor-tax-rate-schedules-ty2026.html", "source_url": "https://www.ncdor.gov/taxes-forms/individual-income-tax/tax-rate-schedules", "version": "2026-09-14-ty2026-indexed-amounts"}
